                "textId": "Performance_802412_3549941412_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "流星……\n长什么样呢？\n想，近距离看看，流星的光芒……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_802412_3549941412_content",
                "value": "流星……\n长什么样呢？\n想，近距离看看，流星的光芒……"
